    <!--
        Traditional-Chinese (zh-Hant) devices fall back to the Simplified Chinese
        strings in values-zh/ instead of the English default. Android 7+ resolves
        Chinese by script, so an unqualified values-zh is treated as zh-Hans and is
        never matched by a zh-TW / zh-HK / zh-MO (Hant) device.

        This file is a verbatim copy of values-zh/strings.xml — do NOT translate it
        here. Edit values-zh/strings.xml and copy the change over; the unit test
        TraditionalChineseFallbackTest fails if the two files ever diverge.
    -->
